# A library's published jars: cardinalityReportOf reads the library's binary jar, its sources jar
# naming and placing the rows, which is how a dependency's types get measured without vendoring
# them into this build. Either jar alone is refused.
> librarySources
> libraryBinary
> cardinalityReportOf library.jar library-sources.jar
> checkTasty
-> cardinalityReportOf library.jar
-> cardinalityReportOf library-sources.jar
